The SVG icons in this directory are symbolic icons from the Adwaita icon
theme by the GNOME Project (https://www.gnome.org), copied unmodified so that
logpy's fuzzel menus do not depend on the icon theme installed on the system.

They are licensed under the terms of either the GNU Lesser General Public
License version 3 or the Creative Commons Attribution-Share Alike 3.0 United
States License, at your option.

  https://www.gnu.org/licenses/lgpl-3.0.html
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/

Source: https://download.gnome.org/sources/adwaita-icon-theme/
